# Testing profile

This file is a DELTA over `aidex-coverage`. Facts about this project only: ports,
names, commands, paths, personas, locale. Never a layer rule, never a copy of the
canon; a deviation from the rubric is a decision in `.context/decisions/`.

Read by `aidex-coverage` (which resolves `testing_packs` to the stack packs holding the
framework-specific test shapes and infrastructure), by every `{{key}}` in those packs, by
the packs' generators (e.g. `testing-playwright-app/scripts/gen-test-e2e.sh`, which writes
`test-e2e.sh` from it) and by `aidex-audit affected-tests` (the `*_test_cmd` keys). Canon:
`${CLAUDE_PLUGIN_ROOT}/skills/aidex-coverage/references/14-testing-profile.md`.
